		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 8, Damage: Soul power. Deal Cold damage and inflict Soul Touched. Deal no damage when targeting an ally.</p><p>Your <strong>soul power</strong> scales as you level:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Level 1</strong> — soul power is 1d8.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 5</strong> (Soul Twist 2) — soul power is 2d8.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 10</strong> (Soul Twist 3) — soul power is 3d8.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 15</strong> (Soul Twist 4) — soul power is 4d8.</p></li><li><p><strong>Level 20</strong> (Master of the Veil) — soul power is 5d8.</p></li></ul><p><em>Soul power is also the damage/temp-HP value referenced by Soul Rite and many Soul Sculpting techniques.</em></p>",
